coords era
levels 5-60
zone Ironforge

# First Aid 1-300 for both factions: bandage recipes in orange/yellow order from
# professions.json, learned on as few trainer visits as the recipes allow (learn
# skills and prices: Forever's sniffed trainer lists). Expert is a book (Deneb
# Walker, Stromgarde / Balai Lok'Wein, Brackenwall Village); Artisan is the
# Triage quest, and the Triage doctor teaches the Artisan bandages. Forever also
# teaches healing potions, anti-venoms, poultices and tourniquets in First Aid:
# the potions are the herbalist's alternative (tips at 1, 55 and 110).
# Craft counts use the Classic skill-up chance (grey - skill) / (grey - yellow).
# INGAME: can a character under level 20 read Expert First Aid - Under Wraps at
# skill 125? (the book carries no level requirement; Classic guides gate it at 20)
#
# Spawns come from the reference data: the Era baseline (pfQuest) plus the
# node spawns Forever's beta sniffs add (Zephras Isle, the starting-area Poor
# Copper Veins and herbs: the Forever TrinityCore world DB); trainer learn skills
# and prices from Forever's sniffed trainer lists; recipes and their skill colours
# from the Forever client tables (`forge data professions`).
# ASSUMED: past level 30 (the beta's cap) Forever's spawns are Classic's; nothing
# confirms them yet. In-game check: refine with Polestar_Recorder sessions.
# Rank level gates: Journeyman Fishing asks level 10 (Forever's sniffed trainer
# list); Cooking's and First Aid's Journeyman ask none (their sniffed lists, and
# players' recordings train them at 6 and 7). In-game check: reading an Expert
# book below level 20.
# Waypoints are Era-frame (`coords era`); the engine converts them where Forever
# changed a map frame, and a map without an Era frame (Zephras Isle) compiles live.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice

section First Aid 1-40

step Learn First Aid
  tip Any First Aid trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice First Aid (any character level, 1s); the arrow picks the nearest. Forever teaches Minor Healing Potion with it: Peacebloom, Mild Spices and an Empty Vial, orange to 55. With Herbalism it can replace the Linen Bandages below.
  train First Aid Apprentice

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- First Aid 1-125

step Linen Bandage: Auction House
  tip What Linen Bandage takes that the Auction House sells: 41 Linen Cloth. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 2589 x41

step Linen Bandage: cloth
  tip Linen Cloth drops from humanoids of level 5-20: keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank.
  collect 2589 x41 anywhere gather levels 5-20

step Linen Bandage (1-40)
  tip Linen Bandage is orange from 1 (yellow at 30, green at 45, grey at 60): about 41 crafts to 40. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. At 20 the trainer also teaches First Aid Kit (1s; the Camping 101: First Aid quest at your starting area's camp teaches it free), Forever's camping item for First Aid: three Linen Bandages and a Refreshing Spring Water; it gives a few points until 25.
  craft 3275 until 40

