# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan First Aid: Triage

section First Aid 225-240

step Trauma
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Artisan First Aid comes from the Triage quest. It needs skill 225 and level 35; the First Aid trainer in Ironforge sends you to the doctor in Theramore. Bring the Mageweave (about 74) and Runecloth (about 65) for 225-300 now: bandages need no fire, so you craft 225-300 beside the doctor, who teaches the Artisan bandages.
  skill "First Aid" 225
  level 35
  accept 6625                             -- Nissa Firestone, Ironforge

step Trauma
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Artisan First Aid comes from the Triage quest. It needs skill 225 and level 35; the First Aid trainer in Orgrimmar sends you to the doctor in Hammerfall. Bring the Mageweave (about 74) and Runecloth (about 65) for 225-300 now: bandages need no fire, so you craft 225-300 beside the doctor, who teaches the Artisan bandages.
  skill "First Aid" 225
  level 35
  accept 6623                             -- Arnok, Orgrimmar

step Triage
  only Alliance
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Triage: the doctor hands you Triage Bandages; use those, not your own. Fifteen wounded soldiers lie inside: bandage the critically injured first, then the badly injured, then the injured, before any die (show the health bars with Ctrl+V). Turn the quest in the moment fifteen are saved: the others keep dying, and too many deaths fail it even after it reads complete. If it fails, abandon it and take it again.
  turnin 6625                             -- Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen, Theramore Isle
  accept 6624
  complete 6624
  turnin 6624                             -- Artisan First Aid

step Triage
  only Horde
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Triage: the doctor hands you Triage Bandages; use those, not your own. Fifteen wounded soldiers lie on the floor inside: bandage the critically injured first, then the badly injured, then the injured, before any die (show the health bars with Ctrl+V). Turn the quest in the moment fifteen are saved: the others keep dying, and too many deaths fail it even after it reads complete. If it fails, abandon it and take it again.
  turnin 6623                             -- Doctor Gregory Victor, Hammerfall
  accept 6622
  complete 6622
  turnin 6622                             -- Artisan First Aid

